   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Periurban W&amp;S, AT, CS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Vice-Ministry of Drinking Water and Basic Sanitation gives        priority to the wat-san services in peri-urban areas, the goal of     this project - similar Sumaj Huasi in the Andean zone - is to         contribute to the wat-san sector in Bolivia through the               implementation and sistematization of innovative models in the Valley zone in Bolivia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Viceministeriet f&#xf6;r dricksvatten och sanitet prioriterar vatten- och  sanitetstj&#xe4;nster i periurbana omr&#xe5;den. M&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r detta projekt &#xe4;r att bidra till vatten- och sanitetssektorn i Bolivia genom att            implementera och systematisera innovativa modeller i Cochabambadalen  i Bolivia.</narrative>
  </description>
